From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Winter <danielwinterw@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 20:34:27 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 15/15] metal: few-row tensor mat-mul prototype behind
 GGML_METAL_MUL_MM_FR (measurement only)

kernel_mul_mm_fr: the tensor-API mul_mm with a small src1 tile for verify-sized
batches of 2-16 rows, in three tile variants (a, b, c). Off unless
GGML_METAL_MUL_MM_FR selects a variant.
